<title>ROMANIA: Higher volumes take Bucharest bourse up.</title>
<headline>Higher volumes take Bucharest bourse up.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Growing volumes on the Bucharest bourse's first tier, as well as more active trading in second-tier stocks, led turnover higher to 3.6 billion lei on Thursday from 2.7 billion in the previous session.</p>
